WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
Sixty days of famine is not the most terrible thing

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:04,080
What's really fatal is protecting Corpse Alley after seven days

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,800
What to do if those beasts come up?

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,880
Senior, you can do without other seasonings.

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,080
But there must be salt

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,440
Not eating salt for a long time may cause hyponatremia

7
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,440
Well, I'll figure it out later.

8
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:15,200
We can get more food in these two days

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,640
Find someone to exchange for resources later

10
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,600
Same thing

11
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:25,550
The place can resist ferocious beasts. Please upgrade it quickly.

12
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:26,990
There are many surprises waiting for you

13
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:28,030
log cabin spirit star

14
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,750
Currently unable to resist the attack of beasts

15
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,230
Currently in protection period

16
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:34,270
Upgrade condition: Wood becomes 100

17
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,670
I still have to cut down trees.

18
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:36,830
A new day begins

19
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:39,030
Basic material tools have been issued to you

20
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,830
Survivors, please try to survive.
